Use [C# conventions](../../.agents/rules/csharp-writing-conventions.md), [ECS conventions](../../.agents/rules/ecs-writing-conventions.md) and [csharp-style](../../.agents/skills/csharp-style/SKILL.md) for the affected code. Read its DI reference only when selecting/matching dependencies; visibility and naming follow the actual owner, not a duplicated private-only example. [Architecture](../../.agents/rules/architecture-and-ownership.md) owns access/layers; [marker syntax](../../.agents/rules/arcane-edit-markers.md) owns inherited edits. In review apply criteria rather than execution procedures.
